Old way:-
Securing data center
securing the networking
securing the servers
securing the OS 
securing application deployed
You own security end to end

But If you are using aws seurity is the team effort between you and aws.
So shared responsibility model is created. 
aws:- physical infrastructure.
      compute, storage, database, networking


costumer:- responsible for outside of that.
	   network, firewall, os, data encryption, server side encryption, networking traffic protection.


IaaS:- Infrastructure as a service
       EC2 elastic compute cloud.

Paas:- Platform as a service.
       AWS Elastic Benstock, AWS Lambda, Amazon Relational Database Service(RDS)

SaaS:- Software as a service.
       It owns everything excent as application data.
       Amazon Workmail, Chime, Workdocs




